Name: EasyList and EasyPrivacy filter lists
Short Name: filter_lists
URL: https://easylist.to/
Version: 202611071252 (EasyList), 202611071246 (EasyPrivacy)
Update Mechanism: Manual
License: GPL-3.0
License File: LICENSE
Shipped: yes
Security Critical: yes

Description:
EasyList and EasyPrivacy, the ad and tracker filter lists. The Filter Engine
(//components/aerie_adblock) compiles them into the engine that blocks requests
in the browser.

EasyList and EasyPrivacy are dual licensed: GPL-3.0-or-later, or CC BY-SA 3.0,
at the user's option (https://easylist.to/pages/licence.html). Aerie uses
them under the GPL-3.0-or-later option.

Local Modifications:
None. easylist.txt and easyprivacy.txt are the files that easylist.to served on
the dates of the versions above, committed byte for byte. filter_lists.lock.json
pins each by sha256 and size, and `./aerie build` fails if one differs.
`./aerie lists update` refreshes the files and the lock. aerie_adblock_compile
compiles them into a serialized engine at build time. Lines that are over 8 KiB,
or that are exception rules matching every URL, are dropped at compile time (see
components/aerie_adblock/rust/core/src/lib.rs).

