Name: Phishing Army phishing domain list
Short Name: phishing_army
URL: https://phishing.army/
Version: 2026-11-07T17:00:30Z
Update Mechanism: Manual
License: Custom license
License File: LICENSE.phishing_army
Shipped: yes
Security Critical: yes

Description:
Phishing Army's community phishing domain blocklist (extended list). The Filter
Engine's protection category (//components/aerie_adblock) compiles it into the
engine that shows the phishing and malware interstitial for a listed domain and
its subdomains. The terms are in LICENSE.phishing_army and at
https://phishing.army/license/.

Local Modifications:
None. phishing_army.txt is the file that phishing.army served at the time in
Version above, committed byte for byte. protection_lists.lock.json pins it by
sha256 and size, and `./aerie build` fails if it differs. `./aerie lists update`
refreshes the file and the lock. aerie_protection_compile compiles it into a
serialized engine at build time (see
components/aerie_adblock/rust/core/src/safety.rs).
